{
  "key": 21510,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WelcomeToBattleground",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? So, you are?!\n",
        "You’re Buck’s friend, yes!\r",
        "I’ve heard about you from both Buck\n",
        "and Wake.\r",
        "Well, my young friend, you’re always\n",
        "welcome here from now on!\r",
        "This is a private club for only Sinnoh’s\n",
        "Gym Leaders, or those vouched for by\f",
        "those selfsame Gym Leaders.\r",
        "It’s a place where the best seek to\n",
        "better themselves.\r",
        "Welcome to the Battleground!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_TalkAboutStarkMountain",
      "en_US": [
        "What should we talk about today?\n",
        "...Ah, I know.\r",
        "Let me tell you about the volcano named\n",
        "Stark Mountain.\r",
        "That volcano dates to when Sinnoh was\n",
        "made by the melding of time and space.\r",
        "Fiery lava spilled out and pooled, and\n",
        "then it became a Pokémon.\r",
        "It’s said the Magma Stone was used\n",
        "to keep the Pokémon pinned down.\r",
        "It kept the Pokémon from rampaging\n",
        "and the volcano from erupting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MakeYourselfAtHome",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Battleground!\n",
        "Make yourself at home like always."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy3",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Would you like to battle ?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy4",
      "en_US": "Dawn: See you soon then !"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_OpenToToughestTrainers",
      "en_US": "Dawn: Get ready !"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy6",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hi {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Would you like to battle ?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy7",
      "en_US": "Lucas: See you soon then !"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy8",
      "en_US": "Lucas: Get ready !"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy9",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Ehehehe! You’re here at last!\n",
        "Let’s not waste time! Let’s do this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy10",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Fweh! Too much!\r",
        "I guess I’ll better my team\n",
        "at the Battle Tower."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_Dummy11",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Huh, what?\n",
        "That takes the wind out of my sails.\r",
        "Well, since you’re here, kick back,\n",
        "make yourself at home, and all that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkAskBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering\n",
        "inside their Poké Balls!\r",
        "It’s out of anticipation, not fear!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh, hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You’re my opponent of the day?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkDeclinedBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Being a Trainer isn’t easy.\r",
        "The more you battle, the more you\n",
        "discover.\r",
        "But, you know?\n",
        "I love Pokémon for that, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkAskBattleAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Giggle...\r",
        "Pokémon would get worn out if we\n",
        "battled all the time, wouldn’t they?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Thank you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Thanks to you, my adorable Pokémon\n",
        "became a little tougher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkAskBattle2",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: You and I, we’re both Trainers.\r",
        "Let’s forego the small talk and proceed\n",
        "right to battle.\r",
        "That’s my style!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkIntro2",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Know your enemy.\r",
        "If you know your opponent’s Pokémon\n",
        "and what moves they use...\r",
        "If you have intelligence like that, your\n",
        "chances of winning are much improved."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkDeclinedBattle2",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: We’re pulling out all the stops\n",
        "to put your Pokémon down.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkAskBattleAgain2",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: If I weren’t on Iron Island\n",
        "then...\r",
        "If you hadn’t arrived on Iron Island\n",
        "then...\r",
        "Perhaps we would have never met.\n",
        "Or, would we have met elsewhere?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkDefeat2",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: I...\n",
        "Is it OK to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_RoarkDefeatByronPresent",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: ...You’re so strong.\n",
        "It makes me feel happy.\r",
        "...I don’t know why.\n",
        "This is a strange feeling..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaAskBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: ...If you won’t battle, I might\n",
        "not come back..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: ...I might like battling with\n",
        "you.\r",
        "...Just a little.\n",
        "Only a little tiny bit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaDeclinedBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Please teach Mira about Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaAskBattleAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Mira is a little sad...\n",
        "Mira’s Pokémon are stronger now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Mira will show you that Mira doesn’t get\n",
        "lost anymore, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaAskBattle2",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you are always with\n",
        "your Pokémon.\r",
        "That’s how you got to be so strong.\n",
        "Mira is beginning to understand!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaIntro2",
      "en_US": "Dawn: I need to train harder..."
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaDeclinedBattle2",
      "en_US": "Lucas: I need to train harder..."
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaAskBattleAgain2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}! You\n",
        "aren’t the only one getting tougher!\r",
        "I’ll prove it to you!\n",
        "Let’s go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_GardeniaDefeat2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...!\r",
        "It’s all right, though.\n",
        "Keep getting tougher, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "The more you do, the tougher my\n",
        "Pokémon and I get, too.\r",
        "There’s no end to Pokémon.\n",
        "That’s what I’m saying, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaAskBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "How are you doing?\r",
        "Me? You even need to ask?\n",
        "Piling up the wins at the Battle Tower!\r",
        "Huh? My longest winning streak?\n",
        "What, you’re going to grill me now?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, it’s you,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Did you battle with everyone?\r",
        "Don’t you think it’s kind of cool,\n",
        "though?\r",
        "When people talk about Pokémon, they\n",
        "all start smiling!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaDeclinedBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...!\n",
        "Oh, it’s you, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "You know, the best Trainers must really\n",
        "love Pokémon from their heart.\r",
        "I’m talking about people like the Gym\n",
        "Leaders, of course.\r",
        "People like the Tower Tycoon and the\n",
        "other Frontier Brains, too.\r",
        "You can tell they love Pokémon when\n",
        "you’re battling them.\r",
        "But I’m not conceding anything to\n",
        "them, or to you!\r",
        "Because I’m still going to be the\n",
        "greatest Trainer ever!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaAskBattleAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Palmer: Hi! My name’s Palmer.\n",
        "I remember you from when you were in\r",
        "Twinleaf, you were always playing\n",
        "with my son.\r",
        "You’ve grown up since then, and most\n",
        "impressively, too!\r",
        "So, I’d like you to show me.\n",
        "Show me the bond you’ve built with your\r",
        "Pokémon !"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaDefeat",
      "en_US": "Palmer: Do come visit again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaAskBattle2",
      "en_US": "Palmer: I’ll have to give you my best effort.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaIntro2",
      "en_US": [
        "Palmer: Losing to an outstanding Trainer\n",
        "like you...\r",
        "I can live with that.\\x0000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaDeclinedBattle2",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: Well! My goodness,\n",
        "your Pokémon...It’s got star power\r",
        "beyond belief.\n",
        "Even from inside its Poké Ball,\r",
        "I can feel its charismatic brilliance..\n",
        "That is why we must battle now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaAskBattleAgain2",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: I am Argenta. I’m a Hall\n",
        "Matron who shines while doing\r",
        "the things I truly love.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_FantinaDefeat2",
      "en_US": "Argenta: Bye-bye!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneAskBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: You must never\n",
        "forget there is a place\r",
        "where everyone can shine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don’t mind me.\n",
        "What I’m using is an invention of mine.\r",
        "All righty, let’s get going!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneDeclinedBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Just so you know,\n",
        "my Pokémon knowledge is unbeatable.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneAskBattleAgain",
      "en_US": "Thorton: See you again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "Thorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss\n",
        "here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneAskBattle2",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Welcome. I am Darach, the\n",
        "Castle Valet.\r",
        "En garde!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneIntro2",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Let me assure you,\n",
        "you won’t be shortchanged by facing me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneDeclinedBattle2",
      "en_US": "Darach: Please excuse me."
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneAskBattleAgain2",
      "en_US": "Darach: My hat’s off to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_MayleneDefeat2",
      "en_US": [
        "Dahlia: You have arrived here not\n",
        "merely because you were lucky.\r",
        "Let us not waste any time.\n",
        "I wish to test your skills myself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeAskBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Dahlia: Always be smiling!\n",
        "Luck comes to those who are happy!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeIntro",
      "en_US": "Dahlia: See you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeDeclinedBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Dahlia: Battling a wonderful\n",
        "Trainer is always a happy occasion!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeAskBattleAgain",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Nuggets!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeDefeat",
      "en_US": "You got 50 PP Maxs!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeAskBattle2",
      "en_US": "You Got 2 Masterballs!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeIntro2",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Zincs!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeDeclinedBattle2",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Rare Candies!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeAskBattleAgain2",
      "en_US": "You got 50 HP Ups!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_WakeDefeat2",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Proteins!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_ByronAskBattle",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Irons!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_ByronIntro",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Calciums!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Battleground_Text_ByronDeclinedBattle",
      "en_US": "You got 50 Carbos!"
    }
  ]
}
